# Clean Architecture Boundary Rules

- `Domain` layer: NO dependencies on EF Core, ASP.NET Core, or Infrastructure.
- `Application` layer: Depends only on `Domain`.
- `Infrastructure` layer: Implements interfaces from `Application` and configures EF Core.
- Use Central Package Management (`Directory.Packages.props`). Never add `Version` to `.csproj`.
- Run `dotnet test tests/FastEndpointsTemplate.ArchitectureTests` to verify compliance.
